text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F705 {
    "Hello! I take it you’re a traveler.\pHow’s this? What do you say to taking\non our family of four in a series of\lPOKéMON battles?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F785 {
    "Is that so?\nDrop in, if you change your mind!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F7B3 {
    "That’s the spirit! I like you!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F7D2 {
    "Aiyah!\nYou’re a lot tougher than I expected!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F7FF {
    "Hey, all!\nI’ve found a pretty strong TRAINER!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F82D {
    "Oh, my goodness! Aren’t you young?\pYou must be quite the TRAINER to beat\nmy husband, though.\pIt’s my turn to battle now!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F8A6 {
    "Oh, gosh!\nI can’t get over how strong you are!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F8D5 {
    "There’s a strong TRAINER here!\nThis one’s really strong!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F90E {
    "You’re stronger than Mommy? Wow!\pBut I’m strong, too!\nReally! Honestly!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F956 {
    "Huh? Did I just lose?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F96C {
    "This stinks...\p...Snivel... Grandma!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F991 {
    "How dare you make my granddaughter\ncry!\pFor that, I’m going to smack you!\nPrepare to lose!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816F9EC {
    "Kwah! You are strong...\nMy granddaughter was right..."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FA22 {
    "If you’re not in any hurry, visit with\nus awhile."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FA54 {
    "You found the ROOT FOSSIL.\pIf this FOSSIL is taken, the other\none will sink into the sand...\pTake the ROOT FOSSIL anyway?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FACE {
    "{PLAYER} left the ROOT FOSSIL alone."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FAED {
    "You found the CLAW FOSSIL.\pIf this FOSSIL is taken, the other\none will sink into the sand...\pTake the CLAW FOSSIL anyway?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FB67 {
    "{PLAYER} left the CLAW FOSSIL alone."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FB86 {
    "If you don’t raise your POKéMON some\nmore, it could be tough to keep winning\lup through the ranks.\pI’ve heard the POKéMON LEAGUE’s\nELITE FOUR are far stronger than\lany GYM LEADER."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FC3A {
    "I challenged the WINSTRATE family,\nbut four matches in a row is tough\lgoing... They destroyed me."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FC9C {
    "ROUTE 111\nレ MAUVILLE CITY"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FCB6 {
    "“Our family’s hearts beat as one!”\nTHE WINSTRATE’S HOUSE"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FCEF {
    "ROUTE 111\nロ ROUTE 112"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FD05 {
    "ROUTE 111\nロ ROUTE 113"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FD1B {
    "OLD LADY’S REST STOP\n“Come in and rest your tired bones.”"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_0816FD55 {
    "TRAINER TIPS\pOne of the indicators of a POKéMON’s\npowerfulness is SP. ATK. It stands for\l“SPECIAL ATTACK.”\pLikewise, SP. DEF stands for “SPECIAL\nDEFENSE.”"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081A0F93 {
    "The sandstorm is vicious.\nIt’s impossible to keep going."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081A3520 {
    "What’s that?\nWhat am I doing?\pI’m thinking about making my own room\nhere using a POKéMON move.\pI know! I’ll give you this TM.\nWill you use it to make your own room?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081A35C5 {
    "Find a big tree that looks like it might\ndrop some vines.\pUse SECRET POWER in front of the tree.\nSome vines should get free and drop\ldown, so you can climb the tree.\pYou’ll find a lot of space for putting\nyour favorite things.\pIt’ll be your own secret room...\nA SECRET BASE!\pYou should make one, too.\pAnother thing, you don’t always have\nto make your SECRET BASE in a tree.\pTry using SECRET POWER on rock walls\nthat have small indents in them.\pI’m going to look for other places, too.\nOkay, bye!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081A37B5 {
    "Oh, you don’t want this?\nIf you change your mind, tell me, okay?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081A37F6 {
    "Oh, you don’t have any room for this.\pI’ll hold on to it, so come back for it\nanother time, okay?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081ABF50 {
    "GABBY: Oh! You’re {PLAYER}! Hi!\nDo you remember us from last time?\pCan you show us how much stronger\nyou’ve become? Okay, cue interview!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081ABFD3 {
    "Hemos presenciado una lucha magnífica\nque nunca podremos olvidar."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC015 {
    "GABBY: Awesome! Awesome!\nWho are you?!\pI knew we were onto something wild\nwhen we spotted you!\pOh, please let me explain. We travel\naround everywhere interviewing all\lsorts of TRAINERS.\pSo, would you give us a bit of your time\nfor an interview?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC10A {
    "GABBY: “{STR_VAR_1}!”\pDo you remember? That’s the quote you\ngave us as the battle clincher last time.\pI never, ever forget stuff like that!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC18D {
    "The last time we battled, you stomped\nus before we could brace ourselves...\pAnyway, what do you think?\nDo you want to be interviewed again?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC219 {
    "The last time we battled, didn’t you\nthrow a POKé BALL at us?\pWe were shocked! So we told everyone,\njust everyone, about it!\pAnyway, what do you think?\nDo you want to be interviewed again?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC2D6 {
    "The last time we battled, your item\nskills cleverly did us in.\pAnyway, what do you think?\nDo you want to be interviewed again?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC355 {
    "The last time we battled, we managed\nto look respectable.\pAnyway, what do you think?\nDo you want to be interviewed again?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC3CF {
    "Anyway, what do you think?\nDo you want to be interviewed again?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC40F {
    "¿Lo harás?\p¿Serás capaz de resumir esta compleja\namalgama de sentimientos que ha sido\lesta pelea… en una sola palabra?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC487 {
    "Ehhh…\nBonita palabra…\l…creo.\pA pesar de ella seguiremos\nmuy de cerca tu carrera.\pPero todavìa hay mucho que ver\nen esta isla.\pY seguiremos el reportaje\ntras una breve pausa…\pEsperadnos hasta entonces."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC553 {
    "¿No dices nada?\pEs igual, no creas que voy a llorar.\nEl reportaje sigue."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC59E {
    "GABBY: We’ll be keeping an eye out\nfor you!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC5CA {
    "GABBY: Is there a strong TRAINER\nanywhere with a lot of POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC60B {
    "GABBY: Wow, you are something!\pYou’ve gotten a lot stronger - a lot -\nsince we last battled.\pWe were right about you when we\nspotted you as a hot TRAINER.\pSo, anyway, what do you think?\nAre you willing to give us an interview\lthis time?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC6F8 {
    "GABBY: That was an intense battle!\nDid you get all that on camera?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC790 {
    "TY: Hey, lookie here!\nI remember you!\pI’ll get this battle all on this\nhere camera!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC7E4 {
    "¡Gran batalla!\pAhora… \n¿Podrías dedicarnos unas palabritas?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC820 {
    "TY: Do you only have the one POKéMON\nand that’s it?\pIf you had more POKéMON, it’d make for\nbetter footage, but..."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081AC8D7 {
    " \nÇÀ\nep, I got it all.\nThat whole battle’s on camera."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAB4B {
    "Oh, hey! Those GO-GOGGLES suit you.\nBut I think they look better on me.\pLet’s decide who they look better on\nwith a battle!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BABC7 {
    "I couldn’t see what was happening at my\nsides because of the GO-GOGGLES."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAC10 {
    "The GO-GOGGLES make it possible to\nget through sandstorms.\lThat makes me happy!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAC60 {
    "I’m having a picnic in the desert.\pYou can always find a TRAINER, so\nI can enjoy a battle here, too!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BACC5 {
    "Ohhh! You’re mean!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BACD8 {
    "When you’re battling in a sandstorm,\nwatch out for your POKéMON’s HP.\pIt can faint if you don’t keep an eye\non it!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAD4B {
    "Wearing these GO-GOGGLES makes me\nfeel like a superhero.\lRight now, nobody can beat me!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BADA3 {
    "I can’t win on spirit alone..."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BADC2 {
    "I’m going to be a real hero one day.\nI’m going to work harder to make me\land my POKéMON stronger."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAE24 {
    "I heard there are fossils to be found\nin the desert. Where could they be?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAE6E {
    "I came up short..."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAE81 {
    "If they can find fossils in the desert,\nit must have been a sea before."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAEC9 {
    "For thirty years I have searched for\nancient ruins!\lI am to be challenged?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAF14 {
    "While I have searched for ruins, I’ve\nnot searched for strong POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAF5B {
    "For thirty years I have searched for\nancient ruins!\pNo, wait, was that forty years?\nWhich was it now?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BAFC1 {
    "For thirty years I have searched for\nancient ruins!\pNo, wait, was that forty years?\nAnyway, am I to be challenged?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB034 {
    "I’ve found no ruins, nor have I found\nany strong POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB070 {
    "For thirty years I have searched for\nancient ruins!\pNo, wait, was that forty years I’ve\nsearched?\pHmm... It could even be fifty...\nHow long have I been at this?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB111 {
    "I’m full of pep!\nAnd my POKéMON is peppy, too!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB140 {
    "My POKéMON lost its pep..."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB15B {
    "When I see a TRAINER with a lot of pep,\nI can’t help looking."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB199 {
    "I don’t know where you’re going, but\nwould you like to battle?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB1D8 {
    "Oh, you’re disgustingly good!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB1F6 {
    "I’m thinking that I should go to\nMT. CHIMNEY, but the view around\lhere is very nice, too."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB250 {
    "To train myself, I challenge all\nwhom I meet!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB27E {
    "Uncle! I give up!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB290 {
    "All I can do is keep training until\nI can defeat strong TRAINERS such\las yourself."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB2E3 {
    "Show me how much you’ve toughened\nyour POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB313 {
    "I see, you’ve toughened them\nconsiderably."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB33E {
    "POKéMON and TRAINERS learn much\nthrough battling.\pWhat’s important is to never give up\neven if you lose."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB3A7 {
    "We’re training here to elevate our\ngame to the next level.\lStay and train with us!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB3FA {
    "Ooh, you’re decent!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB40E {
    "Since you’re that strong, you should\naim for the POKéMON LEAGUE."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB44F {
    "Oh, your POKéMON look like serious\nactors.\lI have to ask you for an engagement."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB49F {
    "They didn’t just look strong, they\nare strong!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB4CE {
    "I thought I was raising my POKéMON\ndiligently, but, oh no, there is still\lmuch to be done."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB529 {
    "You can make POKéMON stronger or\nweaker depending on the moves you\lteach them.\pWhat kinds of moves do your POKéMON\nknow?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB5A2 {
    "You’ve taught them good moves!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081BB5C1 {
    "Maybe I should have stopped my\nPOKéMON from evolving until they\llearned better moves..."
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081C56F0 {
    "I watered my plants lots and lots!\nA whole bunch of flowers bloomed!\pAnd then a whole bunch of BERRIES\nappeared!\pHere you go!\nYou can have this!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081C5781 {
    "I’m going to try really hard and make\nsome RED オカキクケS!\pI hope you try hard, too!"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_081C57D2 {
    "I wonder what color BERRIES I’ll look\nfor today?"
}

text Naranja_Route111_G00_M26_Text_086B4C10 {
    "¡Buenos días audiencia!\pHoy nos situamos en una isla al norte\nde Trovita, con un gran equipo y con el \lcampeón de la liga Añil: {PLAYER}.\pVamos, lucha {PLAYER}.\n¡Ahora el protagonista eres tù!"
}
